{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready for Round 2? Wanna find out how far one penguin can really fly? Warm up your swing and make the world your fairway!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/5104b28cd61fd46dde2888ef4cd8c3ef.poster.avif?t=1774670665\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/5104b28cd61fd46dde2888ef4cd8c3ef.webm?t=1774670665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/5104b28cd61fd46dde2888ef4cd8c3ef.mp4?t=1774670665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your favorite penguin is back\u2014and the whole world is his runway. Aim with the new \u201cSwing Arc,\u201d click once, and watch him rocket into rag-doll glory. A perfect hit breaks records; a bad one ends in face-plant comedy. Either way, it\u2019s fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/17201c5b0ea9ecae0cef50035e09bbb3.poster.avif?t=1774670665\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/17201c5b0ea9ecae0cef50035e09bbb3.webm?t=1774670665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/17201c5b0ea9ecae0cef50035e09bbb3.mp4?t=1774670665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each launch begins on a branching world map. Choose your route, sniff out secret shortcuts, and pick the mode that fits your mood:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Campaign \u2013 Clear the Level Map node by node, finish unique quests, and unlock every bat, booster, and skin along the way.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Arcade \u2013 Jump into bite-size score runs loaded with random wacky boosters and fresh cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/df2b6543d12ce8b18ae6c9b66fa58537.poster.avif?t=1774670665\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/df2b6543d12ce8b18ae6c9b66fa58537.webm?t=1774670665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/df2b6543d12ce8b18ae6c9b66fa58537.mp4?t=1774670665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh art style powers 10 hand-crafted biomes\u2014Arctic ice, deep Oceans, glowing Mushroom World, cozy Fall forest, wild Jungle, and more. Each zone drops new gadgets, bouncy critters, plus bats and boosters to collect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/1f706b25b57606deb8ee8a1426d9e85e.poster.avif?t=1774670665\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/1f706b25b57606deb8ee8a1426d9e85e.webm?t=1774670665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/1f706b25b57606deb8ee8a1426d9e85e.mp4?t=1774670665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bronze-to-Diamond leagues reset every month. Distance, speed, or most combos - there\u2019s a leaderboard for it. Climb high, earn exclusive skins, and become the top penguin-launcher on Earth.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936420?t=1774670665","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936420?t=1774670665","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/60acc3526f67203e6d7fb27dfbd23529971b4747/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774670665","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/60acc3526f67203e6d7fb27dfbd23529971b4747/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774670665","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4091980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready for Round 2? Wanna find out how far one penguin can really fly? Warm up your swing and make the world your fairway!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/5104b28cd61fd46dde2888ef4cd8c3ef.poster.avif?t=1774670665\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/5104b28cd61fd46dde2888ef4cd8c3ef.webm?t=1774670665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/5104b28cd61fd46dde2888ef4cd8c3ef.mp4?t=1774670665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your favorite penguin is back\u2014and the whole world is his runway. Aim with the new \u201cSwing Arc,\u201d click once, and watch him rocket into rag-doll glory. A perfect hit breaks records; a bad one ends in face-plant comedy. Either way, it\u2019s fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/17201c5b0ea9ecae0cef50035e09bbb3.poster.avif?t=1774670665\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/17201c5b0ea9ecae0cef50035e09bbb3.webm?t=1774670665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/17201c5b0ea9ecae0cef50035e09bbb3.mp4?t=1774670665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each launch begins on a branching world map. Choose your route, sniff out secret shortcuts, and pick the mode that fits your mood:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Campaign \u2013 Clear the Level Map node by node, finish unique quests, and unlock every bat, booster, and skin along the way.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Arcade \u2013 Jump into bite-size score runs loaded with random wacky boosters and fresh cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/df2b6543d12ce8b18ae6c9b66fa58537.poster.avif?t=1774670665\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/df2b6543d12ce8b18ae6c9b66fa58537.webm?t=1774670665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/df2b6543d12ce8b18ae6c9b66fa58537.mp4?t=1774670665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh art style powers 10 hand-crafted biomes\u2014Arctic ice, deep Oceans, glowing Mushroom World, cozy Fall forest, wild Jungle, and more. Each zone drops new gadgets, bouncy critters, plus bats and boosters to collect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/1f706b25b57606deb8ee8a1426d9e85e.poster.avif?t=1774670665\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/1f706b25b57606deb8ee8a1426d9e85e.webm?t=1774670665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/extras/1f706b25b57606deb8ee8a1426d9e85e.mp4?t=1774670665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bronze-to-Diamond leagues reset every month. Distance, speed, or most combos - there\u2019s a leaderboard for it. Climb high, earn exclusive skins, and become the top penguin-launcher on Earth.</p>","developers":["Playgendary","JoyBits Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936420/09d68ce222134b0de771d1990b82bc0fa361c371/header.jpg?t=1774670665","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3936420/1505220172/bf9bba9e7241251a8c3959edc5ffe05283f97814/1760356221/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760357127","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3936420/1505220172/bf9bba9e7241251a8c3959edc5ffe05283f97814/1760356221/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760357127","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3936420/1505220172/bf9bba9e7241251a8c3959edc5ffe05283f97814/1760356221/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760357127","id":257216949,"name":"Bouncemasters 2: Pengu Throw | Demo Release Tra